 C,S,\\kappa\">\\(\\langle C_\\delta:\\delta\\in S\\rangle,\\vec C,S,\\kappa\\)</span> (sequence parameters)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ClubGuessingSequence}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ClubGuessingSequence}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ClubSubset}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ClubSubset}_S\\)</span> (club-subset predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3343ee70542e7296\" href=\"?note=3343ee70542e7296\" title=\"58-df-zfc-club-subset\">58-df-zfc-club-subset</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Stationary}\">\\(\\operatorname{Stationary}\\)</span> (stationarity predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b802c3dd76418d95\" href=\"?note=b802c3dd76418d95\" title=\"58-df-stationary\">58-df-stationary</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}club\\text{-}guessing\\text{-}sequence} \\vdash \\mathrm{ClubGuessingSequence}_S(\\vec C,S,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{Stationary}(S,\\kappa)\\land\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec C)=S\\land\\forall\\delta\\in S\\;\\exists!C\\;(\\langle\\delta,C\\rangle\\in\\vec C)\\land\\forall\\delta\\in S\\;\\mathrm{ClubSubset}_S(\\vec C(\\delta),\\delta)\\land\\forall D\\;(\\mathrm{ClubSubset}_S(D,\\kappa)\\to\\exists\\delta\\in S\\;(\\vec C(\\delta)\\subseteq D))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}club\\text{-}guessing\\text{-}sequence} \\vdash \\mathrm{ClubGuessingSequence}_S(\\vec C,S,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{Stationary}(S,\\kappa)\\land\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec C)=S\\land\\forall\\delta\\in S\\;\\exists!C\\;(\\langle\\delta,C\\rangle\\in\\vec C)\\land\\forall\\delta\\in S\\;\\mathrm{ClubSubset}_S(\\vec C(\\delta),\\delta)\\land\\forall D\\;(\\mathrm{ClubSubset}_S(D,\\kappa)\\to\\exists\\delta\\in S\\;(\\vec C(\\delta)\\subseteq D))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n<li><code>58-df-zfc-large-club-guessing-sequence</code> and <code>58-df-zfc-pcf4-club-guessing-sequence</code> are merged here.</li>\n<li><code>58-df-zfc-comb-club-guessing-sequence</code> is merged here; it used the same club-guessing condition.</li>\n<li>Alias predicates are downstream wrappers around the displayed base predicate.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-club-subset","status":"resolved","id":"3343ee70542e7296","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-club-subset]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-stationary","status":"resolved","id":"b802c3dd76418d95","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-stationary]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-club-subset","status":"resolved","id":"3343ee70542e7296","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ClubSubset}_S$ (club-subset predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-club-subset]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-stationary","status":"resolved","id":"b802c3dd76418d95","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Stationary}$ (stationarity predicate, see [[58-df-stationary]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\langle C_\\delta:\\delta\\in S\\rangle,\\vec C,S,\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ClubGuessingSequence}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ClubSubset}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Stationary}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}club\\text{-}guessing\\text{-}sequence} \\vdash \\mathrm{ClubGuessingSequence}_S(\\vec C,S,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{Stationary}(S,\\kappa)\\land\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec C)=S\\land\\forall\\delta\\in S\\;\\exists!C\\;(\\langle\\delta,C\\rangle\\in\\vec C)\\land\\forall\\delta\\in S\\;\\mathrm{ClubSubset}_S(\\vec C(\\delta),\\delta)\\land\\forall D\\;(\\mathrm{ClubSubset}_S(D,\\kappa)\\to\\exists\\delta\\in S\\;(\\vec C(\\delta)\\subseteq D))","display":true}],"bytes":1649,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1623","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-zfc-club-guessing-sequence.md|58-df-zfc-club-guessing-sequence]]（batch12）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","3343ee70542e7296","b802c3dd76418d95"]}